---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy — NodalPulse"
  description="NodalPulse privacy policy: what we collect, how we use it, and how to contact us."
>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">

      <div class="page-header">
        <h1 class="page-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="page-sub">Last updated: May 10, 2025</p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-body">

        <div class="sec-section">
          <h2 class="sec-heading">What we collect</h2>
          <p>
            NodalPulse collects the minimum information necessary to deliver the service: your email address,
            display name, and OAuth provider identifier (if you sign in via Microsoft or Google). We store
            a record of your account, session tokens, and your brief delivery preferences.
          </p>
          <p>
            We do not collect payment card numbers directly. Payment processing is handled by Stripe, which
            is subject to its own privacy policy and PCI-DSS compliance obligations.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="sec-section">
          <h2 class="sec-heading">How we use it</h2>
          <p>
            Your email address is used exclusively to deliver morning briefs and transactional messages
            (sign-in links, billing notifications). We do not send marketing email unless you explicitly
            opt in. We do not sell, rent, or share personal data with third parties for advertising purposes.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="sec-section">
          <h2 class="sec-heading">Third-party services</h2>
          <p>
            NodalPulse uses the following processors: Railway (application hosting and database),
            Cloudflare R2 (document storage), Stripe (billing), Brevo (transactional email),
            Sentry (error tracking), and PostHog (product analytics). Each processor handles data
            only as necessary to perform the service and is bound by appropriate data processing agreements.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="sec-section">
          <h2 class="sec-heading">Data retention</h2>
          <p>
            Account data is retained for the duration of your subscription plus 90 days, after which it
            is deleted upon request. Brief content is retained for 12 months. You may request deletion
            of your account at any time by contacting us at the address below.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="sec-section">
          <h2 class="sec-heading">Contact</h2>
          <p>
            Questions about this policy: <a href="mailto:privacy@nodalpulse.com">privacy@nodalpulse.com</a>
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>
